---
const useWhen = [
  "Your project (or your team's projects) uses two or more AI coding assistants.",
  "Your team wants to standardise instructions, skills, and conventions across agents.",
  "You have reusable skills, sub-agents, or commands that should be shared between projects.",
  "You want a plugin system to distribute team-wide configurations across your fleet.",
  "You need reproducibility across developer machines and CI without leaking personal preferences.",
];
const skipWhen = [
  "Your project uses only one AI coding assistant and you're confident you won't add a second.",
  "You have no need for shared configurations across projects.",
  "Editing the tool's native files directly is fast enough for your workflow.",
];
---

<section class="fits" data-section="when">
  <div class="fits__head">
    <p class="eyebrow">Is this for you?</p>
    <h2 class="fits__title">Honest about the fit.</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="fits__grid">
    <div class="fits__col fits__col--use">
      <h3 class="fits__subtitle">Use Agloom when</h3>
      <ul>
        {useWhen.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="fits__col fits__col--skip">
      <h3 class="fits__subtitle">Skip Agloom when</h3>
      <ul>
        {skipWhen.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="fits__kicker">
    Agloom is overhead in exchange for leverage. If you don't have the leverage to gain, the overhead isn't worth it.
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .fits {
    padding: var(--space-20) 0 var(--space-6);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-6);
  }
  .fits__head {
    max-width: none;
    width: 100%;
    text-align: left;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }
  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-mono-tag);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-fg-muted);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }
  .eyebrow::before {
    content: "";
    width: 24px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .fits__title {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-display);
    color: var(--color-fg);
  }
  .fits__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-6);
    width: 100%;
  }
  .fits__col {
    padding: var(--space-8);
    background: rgba(10, 11, 15, 0.7);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  }
  .fits__col--use {
    border-color: rgba(136, 164, 196, 0.3);
  }
  .fits__subtitle {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-4);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: var(--color-fg);
  }
  .fits__col--use .fits__subtitle { color: var(--color-spark); }
  .fits__col ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }
  .fits__col li {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-fg-muted);
    padding-left: var(--space-4);
    position: relative;
  }
  .fits__col--use li::before {
    content: "+";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .fits__col--skip li::before {
    content: "—";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--color-fg-muted);
  }

  .fits__kicker {
    margin: 0;
    text-align: center;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: var(--color-fg);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  @media (max-width: 780px) {
    .fits__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
